  "description": "Optional native codecs and colour management for EasyImageSharp in one package: AVIF (libavif 1.x with libaom: 8/10/12-bit stills and sequences), JPEG XL (libjxl: 8/16-bit and float, animation, lossless and lossy) and LittleCMS ICC v2/v4 transforms (RGB, CMYK, Gray, Lab, XYZ, LUT profiles, rendering intents, black-point compensation). Resource limits are enforced before pixel allocation. Windows x64 runtimes are bundled; Linux and macOS use the system libraries.",
